## Customization

| CSS variable | Used for |
|--------------|----------|
| `--tx-flat-radio-track-bg` | Track fill; defaults to `--tx-fill-color`. |
| `--tx-flat-radio-indicator-bg` | Thumb and multi-select item fill; defaults to `--tx-surface-raised`. |
| `--tx-flat-radio-indicator-shadow` | Thumb shadow. |
